---
layout: base.njk
title: "Projects"
description: "AYP's corporate services and project philosophy."
permalink: /projects/
---
<main>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-navy to-white"></div>
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-64 w-64 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-orange/25 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-14 pb-10 sm:pt-20">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/80 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-navy shadow-soft">
          <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-orange" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Corporate & Services
        </div>
        <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">“接続”をつくる、事業のかたち。</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-white/90">
          AYPは企画・編集・デザイン・運用を一体で設計し、情報発信やブランド活動を迷いなく前に進められる構造にします。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12">
    <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">Content</div>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy">範囲の設計</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">対象・目的・導線を一枚絵に整理。静的でも伝わる構造にします。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">Digital</div>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy">体験の最適化</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Web体験の更新しやすさと表現を両立させるテンプレートをつくります。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">Brand</div>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy">運用を支える</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">ロゴ／トーン／文章の統一。更新導線と権限の整理も含みます。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-4 pt-2">
    <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy">導入のプロセス</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-700">“考え”を、“見える体験”に変えるまでの流れです。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-4">
      {% for step in ["ヒアリング", "設計", "実装", "運用・改善"] %}
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-orange">Step {{ "0" ~ loop.index }}</div>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy">{{ step }}</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
            {% if loop.index == 1 %}現状・課題・伝えたいことを整理します。{% elif loop.index == 2 %}情報設計と導線、必要なページ構成を決めます。{% elif loop.index == 3 %}静的で速い体験を、実際の画面として作ります。{% else %}文章・更新導線を整え、継続しやすくします。{% endif %}
          </p>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 p-7">
      <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy">事業領域（現在の準備状況）</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-slate-700">詳細はページで順次公開します。まずは全体像をご覧ください。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <a href="/projects/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:opacity-95">事業を見る</a>
          <a href="/about/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-navy hover:bg-slate-50">理念へ</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">Content</div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-sm font-bold text-navy">情報発信設計</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">Digital</div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-sm font-bold text-navy">Web体験の最適化</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-soft">
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">Brand</div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-sm font-bold text-navy">ブランド運用の設計</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-16">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-navy p-8 text-white shadow-soft">
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-center">
        <div class="md:col-span-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">まずは一度、相談してみませんか？</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-white/85">要件が固まっていなくても、現状を聞かせてください。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-4">
          <a href="/contact/" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:opacity-95">お問い合わせ</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
